  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing SSG/R Policy &amp; Practice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Specifically, the project will focus on three pillars: &#x2022;Shaping policy by using specific country examples or case studies to analyse pathways for change and innovative approaches to overcoming common challenges in different contexts. &#x2022;Strengthening approaches to monitoring, evaluating and learning from SSG/R programmes. &#x2022;Responding to emerging security needs, for example through conducting in-country scoping and assessment missions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Enhancing SSG/R Policy &amp; Practice project is designed to support the Government of the Netherlands in identifying and responding to new developments in the field of SSG/R and designing and implementing evidence-based SSG/R programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
